  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building the capacity of the Lebanese Palestinian Dialogue Committee (LPDC) to enhance the Lebanese response to the Palestinian refugee presence in Le</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance the capacity of the Lebanese Palestinian Dialogue Committee (LPDC) to effectively coordinate and address the Palestinian refugee file in Lebanon. Building the LPDC&#x2019;s institutional capabilities, developing socio-economic and governance reform projects, and fostering dialogue between Palestinian and Lebanese stakeholders. By addressing immediate and long-term needs, including security and compliance with UNSCR 1701, the project seeks to promote sustainable development and strengthen the LPDC&apos;s role in managing post-conflict challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
